          {
            "title": "Example: Function",
            "id": 79908,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan keyword <code>def</code> untuk melengkapi fungsi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"weather_update\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Weather update&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sunny skies ahead&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"weather_update()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Weather update\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Sunny skies ahead\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>def</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Function name",
            "id": 79918,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Beri nama fungsi ini dalam snake case.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"night_routine\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lights off&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alarm set&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"night_routine()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"nightroutine\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Lights off\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Alarm set\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>night_routine</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gunakan kata terpisah <code>night</code> dan <code>routine</code> dalam snake case, sesuai urutan tersebut, untuk definisi dan pemanggilan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"night_routine\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lights off&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alarm set&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"night_routine()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"nightroutine\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Lights off\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Alarm set\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>night_routine</code>, diikuti oleh <code>night_routine</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
